# Power Surge counts only what was an untapped land as the turn began: a permanent that becomes one later in the turn is
# not counted. As turn 3 begins Bot1 controls an untapped Mutavault and an untapped Ornithopter. In the upkeep, with Power
# Surge's ability on the stack, Bot1 animates Mutavault with Mox Ruby's mana (so it stays untapped), and Bot2 casts
# Mirrorweave on it: the Ornithopter becomes a copy of Mutavault, an untapped land (an animation is no copiable value, CR
# 707.2). Power Surge deals 1, for Mutavault alone; counting the untapped lands as they are now would deal 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mutavault
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Power Surge
Mountain x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mirrorweave
Island x27

[Actions]
